          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũũ ũkeethĩwa wonan’yo kwaku: mwaka ũũ mũkaya metĩkĩa, na mwaka wa kelĩ mathongooo mamo; na mwaka wa katatũ vandai, na mũiketha, na vandai mĩũnda ya mĩsavivũ, mũye ũsyao wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 37:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ũtialo ũla mũvonoku wa nyũmba ya Yuta ũkatambũũkya mĩi ĩngĩ ĩlikĩte na nthĩ, na kũsyaa ũsyao welekele ĩũlũ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.37.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.37.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
